msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/help/en/reference/documents.md:23
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Reports {#reports}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/documents.md:26
#, markdown-text
msgid "Under **Statistics** (permission *Statistics and reports*). Every report is available as **PDF** and **CSV** (UTF-8 with BOM, `;` separated, opens directly in Excel). Texts follow the language of the event."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/documents.md:38
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "| Report | Content | Module |\n|---|---|---|\n| Financial report | revenue per programme, awards with their value | – |\n| Revenue by programme and age category | participants, price and subtotal per programme and category | – |\n| Club participants | participants per club, programme and age category | – |\n| Awards | every award given, with shooter, club, programme, value and result | Awards |\n| Awards to hand out | awards not yet collected, with shooter, club, programme, kind and value, plus the cash still to pay out (see [Results](../user-guide/results.md#handout)) | Awards |\n| Club competition | ranking, out of competition and not ranked clubs | Club competition |\n| Special prizes | winners per programme and age category, skipped shooters with the reason (see [Programmes](../user-guide/programmes.md#special-prizes)) | Special prizes |\n| Classifications | every [classification](../user-guide/classifications.md) per class, with the points per programme; parts that do not count are in parentheses | Classifications |\n| Lane bookings | the clubs that asked for lanes through [online booking](../user-guide/online-booking.md), confirmed or still waiting, with contact, slots, lane numbers and announced shooters | Reservations |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/documents.md:39
#, markdown-text
msgid "The PDF of a report is A4, *Awards* in landscape. The ranking of every programme is also a CSV file: rank, last name, first name, year, category, club, series, total and mouches, for programmes with several attempts also the counting attempt and the number of attempts."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
