#. type: Title #
#: ../src/help/en/reference/links.md:1
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Links without login"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/links.md:4
#, markdown-text
msgid "These links open a page without logging in. Whoever has the link can use it, so send it only to the people it is meant for."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/links.md:15
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "| Link | Made by | Shows | Valid |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Kiosk link `/kiosk/<secret>` | **Create kiosk link** on **Kiosk displays** in the configuration | the live rankings of the event: programmes and classifications with *Show on kiosk displays*, and the lane status with *Show lane status on the rankings* | until **revoke** or the event is deleted |\n| Helper link `/h/<secret>` | **Create helper link** on **Helper links** in the configuration | a reduced desk of the event for one [helper role](permissions.md#helper-links) | until **revoke** or the event is deleted |\n| Booking link `/b/<code>` | **Switch on** on **Reservations** in the configuration | the slots of the event with the free lanes per range, and the request form | until **New link** or **Switch off**; requests only until the deadline |\n| Booking manage link `/b/manage/<secret>` | mailed to the club after **Send request** | the status of the club's request; change or cancel it | changes and cancelling until the deadline |\n| Invitation link `/invite/<secret>` | **Invite by email** on **Users** | the club and the role; accept with an account or a new password | seven days; ends when accepted, withdrawn or sent again |\n| Connect page `/connect?code=<code>` | opened by the Standblatt Print Agent app | the computer of the code; club, range and name of the agent | the code: ten minutes; needs a login with *Ranges and printers* |\n| Email confirmation `/verify?token=…` | adding or changing the email address, sign-up | confirms the address | seven days |\n| Password link `/reset-password?token=…` | **Forgot your password?**; the operator in the admin panel | sets a new password | one hour; from the operator seven days |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/links.md:17
#, markdown-text
msgid "The secret part of kiosk, helper, manage and invitation links is shown or mailed once and stored only as a hash: a lost link cannot be shown again, only replaced."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/help/en/reference/links.md:18
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "URL parameters {#parameters}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/links.md:26
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "| Parameter | Link | Effect |\n|---|---|---|\n| `?theme=dark`, `?theme=light` | kiosk | dark or light display |\n| `?language=de` (`fr`, `it`, `en`) | kiosk, helper | language of the page instead of the event's language |\n| `?range=<id>` | kiosk | on an event with several ranges: only that range's lanes, its programmes and the programmes without a range |\n| `?code=` | connect | the code to confirm, filled in by the app |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/links.md:27
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Create kiosk link** writes the theme, the language and the range chosen there into the link.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:1
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Modules"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:4
#, markdown-text
msgid "Modules are the building blocks an event or a club switches on. What is off disappears from the sidebar, the dashboard, the programme editor, the rankings and the reports. How to switch them: [Modules](../user-guide/events.md#modules) and [Club modules](../user-guide/events.md#club-modules)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:5
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Event modules {#event-modules}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:8
#, markdown-text
msgid "Under **Configuration** → **Modules** of an event."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:23
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "| Module | What it adds |\n|---|---|\n| Lane assignment | shooters are registered on lanes: the lane grid on the dashboard, the lane status on kiosk displays and scorer links (needs a range; see below) |\n| Reservations | lanes reserved for groups and clubs; its page in the configuration switches on the [online booking](../user-guide/online-booking.md), through which clubs ask for lanes with a public link (needs a range) |\n| Lane sheet | the lane sheet printed at registration: shooter, lane, programmes and barcodes |\n| Control strip | the control strip printed at registration: the passes the shooter may shoot |\n| Ammunition desk | the **Ammo** button on the dashboard and for the ammunition desk (see [Helpers](../user-guide/helpers.md#ammunition)); leave it off where shooters bring their own, e.g. air pistol and air rifle |\n| Attempts | programmes that can be shot several times (see [Programmes](../user-guide/programmes.md#attempts)) |\n| Awards | wreath cards, prizes in kind and cash prizes by points per age category |\n| Special prizes | the best ranks of every age category (switches on Awards, see [Programmes](../user-guide/programmes.md#special-prizes)) |\n| Club competition | clubs ranked by their shooters' results |\n| Classifications | rankings over several programmes or attempts (see [Classifications](../user-guide/classifications.md)) |\n| Kiosk displays | rankings on screens in the hall (see [Rankings and kiosk](../user-guide/rankings-kiosk.md)) |\n| Helper links | scorers, ammunition desk and results clerk without an account (see [Helpers](../user-guide/helpers.md)) |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:24
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Where a module shows {#places}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:40
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "| Module | Pages and sections |\n|---|---|\n| Lane assignment | lane grid on the dashboard, lanes in the registration, lane status on kiosk displays, role *Scorer* of helper links |\n| Reservations | page **Reservations** of the event, with the booking requests and their count in the sidebar; page **Reservations** in the configuration (online booking); report *Lane bookings* |\n| Lane sheet | *Print lane sheet* in the registration |\n| Control strip | *Print control strip* in the registration |\n| Ammunition desk | **Ammo** button and *ammo* badge on the dashboard and on helper links |\n| Attempts | section **Attempts** of the programme page; counter per programme in the registration |\n| Awards | section **Awards** of the programme page; awards in the results; figures on **Statistics**; reports *Awards* and *Awards to hand out* |\n| Special prizes | section **Special prizes** of the programme page; report *Special prizes* |\n| Club competition | *Counts for the club competition* on the programme page; club competition on **Statistics**; report *Club competition* |\n| Classifications | page **Classifications** in the configuration; tables on **Rankings** and kiosk displays; report *Classifications* |\n| Kiosk displays | page **Kiosk displays** in the configuration; *Show on kiosk displays* on the programme page |\n| Helper links | page **Helper links** in the configuration |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:41
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Rules {#rules}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:57
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "| Module | Requires | Needs a range | Settings | Cannot be switched off while |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Lane assignment | – | yes | – | a registration has a lane |\n| Reservations | Lane assignment | yes | the online booking on its configuration page | the online booking link is active |\n| Lane sheet | – | – | – | – |\n| Control strip | – | – | *Print form of the control strips* | – |\n| Ammunition desk | – | – | – | – |\n| Attempts | – | – | – | a programme allows more than one attempt |\n| Awards | – | – | *Print the award value on wreath cards* (on for a new event), *Print form of the wreath cards* | a programme has award tiers |\n| Special prizes | Awards | – | – | a programme awards special prizes |\n| Club competition | – | – | *Club excluded from the club competition* | – |\n| Classifications | – | – | – | the event has a classification |\n| Kiosk displays | – | – | *Show lane status on the rankings* (with Lane assignment) | the event has a kiosk link |\n| Helper links | – | – | – | the event has a helper link |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:63
#, markdown-text
msgid "A module that another one requires stays on as long as that one is on."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:63
#, markdown-text
msgid "Modules that need a range are off in an event without a range, whatever is chosen (see [Events without lanes](../user-guide/events.md#no-lanes))."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:63
#, markdown-text
msgid "The settings sit on the module's card under **Modules**; *Show lane status on the rankings* is on the page **Kiosk displays**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:63
#, markdown-text
msgid "**Copy for next year** and templates take over the chosen modules and the modules in use."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:63
#, markdown-text
msgid "An event created through the API without a list of modules gets every event module except *Ammunition desk*."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:64
#: ../src/help/en/user-guide/events.md:49
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Club modules {#club-modules}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:67
#, markdown-text
msgid "Under **Club modules** in the club part of the sidebar (permission *Users and club*)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:71
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "| Module | What it adds | Cannot be switched off while |\n|---|---|---|\n| Print forms | forms for pre-printed sheets and the *Print form* section of every programme (see [Print forms](../user-guide/print-forms.md)); page **Print forms** and the permission *Print forms* | the club has a print form or an image |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/modules.md:73
#, markdown-text
msgid "A new club starts with *Print forms* on. With it off, events print the built-in wreath card and control strip."
