#. type: Title #
#: ../src/help/en/reference/permissions.md:1
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Permissions and roles"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/permissions.md:4
#, markdown-text
msgid "A member's role in a club is a set of permissions. Roles are edited under **Users** → **Roles** (see [Roles](../user-guide/users.md#roles)); API tokens carry a selection of the same permissions."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/help/en/reference/permissions.md:5
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Permissions {#permissions}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/permissions.md:19
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "| Permission | Allows |\n|---|---|\n| **See events and rankings** | events, programmes, rankings and classifications |\n| **Run events** | registrations, results, awards, reservations, documents and printing |\n| **Configure events** | create, configure, copy, close and delete events with programmes, classifications, kiosk and helper links and online booking |\n| **Statistics and reports** | statistics, reports with amounts and ranking CSV files |\n| **See shooters and clubs** | the personal data of the master data |\n| **Edit shooters and clubs** | add and change shooters and clubs |\n| **Manage master data** | import shooters, rename, merge and delete clubs, delete shooters |\n| **Ranges and printers** | ranges, print agents and printer settings |\n| **Print forms** | print forms and images (only while the club module is on) |\n| **Users and club** | users, roles, invitations and club modules |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/help/en/reference/permissions.md:23
#, markdown-text
msgid "One of the permissions an action names is enough."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/help/en/reference/permissions.md:23
#, markdown-text
msgid "Without *Run events* an event opens on its rankings."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/help/en/reference/permissions.md:23
#, markdown-text
msgid "The app shows each member only the pages and buttons their role allows."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/help/en/reference/permissions.md:24
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Default roles {#default-roles}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/help/en/reference/permissions.md:32
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
